Item 4 concerns best execution. The firm has not conducted or documented a =
periodic review of the quality of execution obtained from the two broker-de=
alers to which it directs substantially all client transactions, notwithsta=
nding that the firm's own compliance manual requires an annual review. The =
staff also notes that the firm receives research services from both broker-=
dealers and has not evaluated whether the commissions paid are reasonable i=
n relation to the value of the brokerage and research received.<br />
<br />
Please respond within 30 days describing the review procedure the firm will=
 adopt and the period the first review will cover.<br />
